{"page":501,"verses":[{"verse_key":"45:23","surah":45,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَرَءَيْتَ مَنِ ٱتَّخَذَ إِلَـٰهَهُۥ هَوَىٰهُ وَأَضَلَّهُ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ عِلْمٍ وَخَتَمَ عَلَىٰ سَمْعِهِۦ وَقَلْبِهِۦ وَجَعَلَ عَلَىٰ بَصَرِهِۦ غِشَـٰوَةً فَمَن يَهْدِيهِ مِنۢ بَعْدِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ أَفَلَا تَذَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], consider the one who has taken his own desire as a god, whom God allows to stray in the face of knowledge, sealing his ears and heart and covering his eyes- who can guide such a person after God [has done this]? Will you [people] not take heed?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَرَءَيْتَ","en_gloss":"Have you seen","transliteration":"afara-ayta","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَنِ","en_gloss":"(he) who","transliteration":"mani","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذَ","en_gloss":"takes","transliteration":"ittakhadha","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَهُۥ","en_gloss":"(as) his god","transliteration":"ilāhahu","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"هَوَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"his desire","transliteration":"hawāhu","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَضَلَّهُ","en_gloss":"and Allah lets him go astray","transliteration":"wa-aḍallahu","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"and Allah lets him go astray","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"knowingly","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عِلْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"knowingly","transliteration":"ʿil'min","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَخَتَمَ","en_gloss":"and He sets a seal","transliteration":"wakhatama","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"upon","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"سَمْعِهِۦ","en_gloss":"his hearing","transliteration":"samʿihi","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَقَلْبِهِۦ","en_gloss":"and his heart","transliteration":"waqalbihi","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَجَعَلَ","en_gloss":"and puts","transliteration":"wajaʿala","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَصَرِهِۦ","en_gloss":"his vision","transliteration":"baṣarihi","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":17,"ar":"غِشَـٰوَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a veil","transliteration":"ghishāwatan","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"Then who","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَهْدِيهِ","en_gloss":"will guide him","transliteration":"yahdīhi","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":21,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":23,"ar":"أَفَلَا","en_gloss":"Then will not","transliteration":"afalā","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":24,"ar":"تَذَكَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"you receive admonition","transliteration":"tadhakkarūna","verse_key":"45:23"},{"pos":25,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"45:23"}]},{"verse_key":"45:24","surah":45,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ مَا هِىَ إِلَّا حَيَاتُنَا ٱلدُّنْيَا نَمُوتُ وَنَحْيَا وَمَا يُهْلِكُنَآ إِلَّا ٱلدَّهْرُ ۚ وَمَا لَهُم بِذَٰلِكَ مِنْ عِلْمٍ ۖ إِنْ هُمْ إِلَّا يَظُنُّونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They say, ‘There is only our life in this world: we die, we live, nothing but time destroys us.’ They have no knowledge of this; they only follow guesswork. Their only argument,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they say","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"45:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"45:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"45:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"(is) but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"45:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَيَاتُنَا","en_gloss":"our life","transliteration":"ḥayātunā","verse_key":"45:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gl